The generic residual is useful: the validity function waited to see whether both tails were empty or nonempty, allowing 255 impossible dynamic-type branches before it unfolded. I’m factoring it into “validate current pair” plus “validate rest.” That exposes `isInt`/`isStr` immediately after one iterator step, so heap-list and other non-string branches are contradicted before call dispatch.
